      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but to be honest, it feels a bit light. The board is going to want to see much more granular detail to feel confident that we actually looked into everything. \n\nCan you expand this? I need you to really break down each of these sections. Don't just summarize the point, but detail the implications and the specific sub-steps involved in each finding. I'm looking for a more \"exhaustive\" feel to the structure. \n\nAgain, please don't just add fluff or repeat yourself to get a higher score, but I definitely need a lot more bullet points to ensure we aren't missing any granular details in the report. Try to get the structural depth up significantly.",
      "source": "evaluator"
